<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/28/msa@/~part_V__cl_12__subsec_4__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/28/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/28/msa@/~part_V__cl_12__subsec_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam hal pelantikan sebagai Ketua Pengarah, oleh Yang di-Pertuan Agong, atas nasihat Perdana Menteri; atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/28/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/28/msa@/~part_V__cl_12__subsec_4__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/28/msa@/~part_V__cl_12__subsec_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/28/msa@> .
